Date: Sat, 14 Nov 2026 17:39:56 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] Lay out WebKit boxes and truncate legacy line clamps

Emulate unclamped WebKit boxes with flex layout using box-orient; after Stylo adjusts a legacy clamp to flow-root, truncate the Parley layout to its line count.

Co-authored-by: hotty Agent <hotty@neuroplast.io>
---
